1
00:00:08,512 --> 00:00:15,248
♪ [INTRO PLAYS] ♪

2
00:00:15,248 --> 00:00:17,240
Subtitles: Daniel Adam Valle

3
00:00:17,824 --> 00:00:21,728
Hey, Coiny! You're a penny! You're worthless!

4
00:00:21,728 --> 00:00:23,792
Worthless isn't the right word!

5
00:00:23,792 --> 00:00:26,016
You meant to say I'm priceless!

6
00:00:26,016 --> 00:00:29,584
You? Priceless?! Ahahahaha-as IF!

7
00:00:29,584 --> 00:00:32,400
COINY:
Well, at least I have a brain.

8
00:00:32,544 --> 00:00:32,992
AUH!

9
00:00:32,992 --> 00:00:35,680
Whoa, guys. Calm down.

10
00:00:35,728 --> 00:00:38,000
And what would you know, Tennis Ball?

11
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:39,472
You don't even have ARMS!

12
00:00:39,472 --> 00:00:42,912
Well, at least Tennis Ball knows more than you!

13
00:00:42,912 --> 00:00:44,208
Really, Coiny?

14
00:00:44,208 --> 00:00:46,784
You know, I...I would BARF-

15
00:00:46,784 --> 00:00:47,440
ROCKY:
Bleh!

16
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:50,016
-if you won Dream Island!

17
00:00:50,016 --> 00:00:52,432
Well, I wouldn't be surprised if I did!

18
00:00:52,432 --> 00:00:55,504
So let's find out who won't win Dream Island.

19
00:00:55,824 --> 00:00:58,784
Last episode, your little team of three lost again.

20
00:00:59,264 --> 00:01:01,664
Go that way to the Cake at Stake place.

21
00:01:01,904 --> 00:01:03,536
♪ Hork hork hork, glorp glorp ♪

22
00:01:03,536 --> 00:01:05,200
♪ Gloop gloop gloop, doot doot ♪

23
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:06,304
♪ Cake at Stake! ♪

24
00:01:06,304 --> 00:01:14,912
HAHAHAHAHAHA!!!

25
00:01:15,968 --> 00:01:18,896
So the two of you with the most votes will leave the team.

26
00:01:19,312 --> 00:01:24,224
The Grapes will then choose which one of you will
be on their team, and which one will be eliminated.

27
00:01:24,224 --> 00:01:27,520
So that means only one of us is saaafe!

28
00:01:27,520 --> 00:01:29,136
Yes, that's true.

29
00:01:29,440 --> 00:01:32,016
And that safe person happens to be Firey,

30
00:01:32,016 --> 00:01:34,944
who got nine out of the total sixty-one votes.

31
00:01:35,312 --> 00:01:36,848
Tennis Ball and Coiny,

32
00:01:37,152 --> 00:01:41,104
with twenty-two and thirty vote
respectively, you both leave the team.

33
00:01:41,104 --> 00:01:41,712
WHAT?!

34
00:01:41,712 --> 00:01:42,608
Ha-ha!

35
00:01:42,608 --> 00:01:43,152
GRR!

36
00:01:43,440 --> 00:01:44,752
Whoa! Whoa!

37
00:01:45,040 --> 00:01:50,400
If I were you, I would not slap
the most awesome person in the world.

38
00:01:51,056 --> 00:01:54,592
ANNOUNCER:
Coiny and Tennis Ball, you two got the most votes.

39
00:01:54,816 --> 00:01:59,152
It is up to the Squashy Grapes to
decide who will stay or be eliminated.

40
00:01:59,152 --> 00:01:59,920
[SIGH]

41
00:02:00,224 --> 00:02:01,088
Leafy.

42
00:02:01,536 --> 00:02:02,448
Icy.

43
00:02:02,848 --> 00:02:03,792
Blocky.

44
00:02:04,304 --> 00:02:05,248
Please...

45
00:02:05,584 --> 00:02:06,496
let me stay.

46
00:02:07,296 --> 00:02:10,208
Don't think of me as just a Firey slapper.

47
00:02:10,736 --> 00:02:15,072
Think about me as someone
who wants a second chance

48
00:02:15,072 --> 00:02:17,232
at winning Dream Island!

49
00:02:17,408 --> 00:02:19,408
That is the worst speech I've ever-

50
00:02:19,408 --> 00:02:23,264
But if he stays on your team,
he wouldn't do you any good.

51
00:02:23,264 --> 00:02:25,664
He'll just slap Firey all day long.

52
00:02:25,664 --> 00:02:26,800
That's a good point!

53
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:28,512
Wait, wait, NO!

54
00:02:28,688 --> 00:02:31,200
You don't know how badly I wanna stay!

55
00:02:31,200 --> 00:02:33,440
Well, I think our team will have to pick...

56
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:37,984
...Tennis Ball.

57
00:02:37,984 --> 00:02:38,704
WHAAAT?!

58
00:02:38,704 --> 00:02:40,960
Coiny, it looks like it's the end for you.

59
00:02:47,776 --> 00:02:50,384
Yay, Tennis Ball! You're on our team!

60
00:02:50,384 --> 00:02:53,488
Actually, this episode,
we're breaking up the teams.

61
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:55,552
You are the final twelve.

62
00:02:55,760 --> 00:02:58,192
As a result, you're all getting a reward.

63
00:02:58,768 --> 00:03:01,008
BFDI DDSs.

64
00:03:01,312 --> 00:03:04,288
The super fun, portable,
handheld videogame console

65
00:03:04,288 --> 00:03:07,984
will let you play the most
exciting games on twelve screens.

66
00:03:08,160 --> 00:03:09,456
A dodecascreen.

67
00:03:09,632 --> 00:03:11,232
Plus, it's foldable.

68
00:03:11,568 --> 00:03:14,048
So yeah, you can play with those later.

69
00:03:14,304 --> 00:03:15,136
Right now...

70
00:03:16,096 --> 00:03:18,128
you have to climb these ladders.

71
00:03:18,128 --> 00:03:20,352
That is the twelfth contest. Go.

72
00:03:25,248 --> 00:03:27,696
How do I do this?

73
00:03:29,888 --> 00:03:32,080
Come on, people. Let's go!

74
00:03:33,568 --> 00:03:35,440
Ha, ha. Water balloons.

75
00:03:36,144 --> 00:03:36,880
WHOA!

76
00:03:37,024 --> 00:03:38,192
AAAAAAA!

77
00:03:38,720 --> 00:03:41,008
AAAAAAAAAAAAA!!!

78
00:03:46,624 --> 00:03:48,240
YES, number one!

79
00:03:49,776 --> 00:03:51,856
NO, number two!

80
00:03:54,848 --> 00:03:56,640
Oh, no! Oh, nooo!

81
00:03:56,816 --> 00:03:57,552
HEUGH!

82
00:03:59,776 --> 00:04:00,928
- Yeah!
- Yaaay!

83
00:04:00,928 --> 00:04:02,192
Way to go, Pencil.

84
00:04:05,888 --> 00:04:07,072
Good job, Bubble!

85
00:04:07,072 --> 00:04:08,000
Finally!

86
00:04:09,152 --> 00:04:11,728
Oh, now what do we do?

87
00:04:11,952 --> 00:04:12,736
Bleh!

88
00:04:20,224 --> 00:04:24,352
Okay, so now that we are all here,
except for that clumsy Tennis Ball.

89
00:04:24,352 --> 00:04:25,584
let's see the results.

90
00:04:25,584 --> 00:04:28,528
Uh, why are we standing on gray squares?

91
00:04:28,528 --> 00:04:30,096
I'll get to that later.

92
00:04:30,336 --> 00:04:33,728
So anyway, I'm giving you all thirty bonus points.

93
00:04:33,728 --> 00:04:35,936
But this game doesn't even have points!

94
00:04:35,936 --> 00:04:37,248
Well, now it does.

95
00:04:37,504 --> 00:04:39,240
AAAAAAAAAH!!!

96
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:40,896
Whaaaoooh!

97
00:04:40,896 --> 00:04:43,744
Your score carries over
throughout future episodes.

98
00:04:43,744 --> 00:04:46,080
Oh, great! Boring!

99
00:04:46,080 --> 00:04:48,960
Oh, and from now on, no more Win Tokens.

100
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:52,800
So what happens to the two
Win Tokens that I already have?

101
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:55,040
They'll be traded for fifteen points each.

102
00:04:56,752 --> 00:05:01,152
As another bonus, you get points depending
on how well you did in the last contest.

103
00:05:08,640 --> 00:05:13,872
Also, for every vote you got in any of the
previous episodes, that's minus one point.

104
00:05:14,192 --> 00:05:15,104
[LIP SMACKS]

105
00:05:15,104 --> 00:05:17,648
That's weird. Do I taste peanut butter?

106
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:21,504
Okay, maybe not.

107
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:24,256
Anyway, Pencil, as you may know,

108
00:05:24,256 --> 00:05:27,152
you're the only person who
still hasn't ever gotten a vote.

109
00:05:27,152 --> 00:05:27,824
Yeah!

110
00:05:27,824 --> 00:05:30,048
Bubble, however, you got one vote.

111
00:05:30,048 --> 00:05:31,232
Oh, no!

112
00:05:31,232 --> 00:05:32,176
WAAUUGH!

113
00:05:32,304 --> 00:05:35,488
Ice Cube got two votes in episodes six and nine.

114
00:05:35,632 --> 00:05:36,224
Wha?

115
00:05:36,672 --> 00:05:39,856
Leafy and Eraser, you each
have gotten three votes.

116
00:05:41,936 --> 00:05:42,656
No!

117
00:05:42,816 --> 00:05:45,408
Match and Pen, you each have gotten four votes.

118
00:05:46,576 --> 00:05:48,640
OMG, seriously?

119
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:53,072
Well, I'm still in first!

120
00:05:53,424 --> 00:05:56,080
Blocky, you've gotten ten elimination votes.

121
00:05:58,144 --> 00:06:01,056
And Firey, you got a total of fourteen votes.

122
00:06:03,248 --> 00:06:04,256
Hey, Firey!

123
00:06:04,256 --> 00:06:06,000
Rocky's received fifteen votes.

124
00:06:08,448 --> 00:06:12,704
Snowball, you've been voted for
eighteen times, all in episode nine.

125
00:06:12,704 --> 00:06:13,632
Bye-bye.

126
00:06:16,256 --> 00:06:17,712
Ha-ha! Ha-ha!

127
00:06:17,712 --> 00:06:20,048
That laugh isn't fooling anyone!

128
00:06:20,256 --> 00:06:25,072
Tennis Ball, out of everyone here, you've
received the most votes, at twenty-five.

129
00:06:27,952 --> 00:06:30,336
So these are your current scores.

130
00:06:30,336 --> 00:06:33,792
Snowball, Bubble, Rocky, and Tennis Ball,

131
00:06:33,792 --> 00:06:38,240
you are the bottom third, so the voting
will only be between the four of you.

132
00:06:38,608 --> 00:06:41,920
Voters, it is your time to cast your ballots.

133
00:06:42,208 --> 00:06:44,976
The person with the most
votes will be eliminated.

134
00:06:51,024 --> 00:06:52,000
Firey?

135
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:52,912
Yeah?

136
00:06:52,912 --> 00:06:57,520
I suggest you don't go around setting
people you don't know on fire.

137
00:06:57,520 --> 00:07:08,444
Oh, my gosh! Oh, my gosh! Oh, my gosh!
Oh, my gosh! Oh, my gosh! Oh, my gosh!